---
// The body column of a detail page (an entry's or a visit's): the rendered
// Markdown only, shared by EntryDetail and /status/<id>. `relative` stacks the
// text above the persisted fixed map layer (positioned elements paint over it in
// tree order); pointer-events-none + auto children let clicks in the gaps still
// reach the map square behind, while the text stays selectable.
---

<main class="pointer-events-none relative max-w-2xl p-4 pl-8 text-sm sm:p-8 sm:pl-12">
  <div class="pointer-events-auto">
    <slot />
  </div>
</main>
